  'app.primerTitle': 'How app registration works',
  'app.primerIntro': 'myidsan is the identity provider. A registered app never sees a password: it sends the user here to sign in and gets back a signed token saying who they are. The app stays in charge of what that person may do — myidsan issues identity, not roles.',
